# Markdown. NOT a style preference - Prettier corrupts these documents.
#
# `todo.md` and `ROADMAP.md` are the repo's decision record: long hand-wrapped
# prose, nested blockquotes inside `- [ ]` items, and cross-references by item
# number. Prettier re-indents a blockquote's continuation lines without moving
# its first line, which splits the quote and renders the remainder as an
# indented code block - it did exactly that to todo.md item 1.1. It also
# rewrites every `*emphasis*` to `_emphasis_` across ~140KB of prose.
#
# The reference is no guide here: its only markdown is a one-line README, so it
# has never run Prettier over a prose document.
*.md
